Folia (enhanced branch)
========================

This repository is a modified fork of Folia, published as `foliamajor-download`.

Original project
----------------

  Folia — Lyrics Reimagined
  https://github.com/chthollyphile/folia-major
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

  Copyright (C) chthollyphile and the folia-major contributors (see CONTRIBUTORS.md).

Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

  Date: October 2026
  Scope: new online sources (Kuwo, Xinghai, a custom HTTP source), a fallback for
         permission-locked songs, clip detection, same-name-different-version exclusion,
         full-track download, guest access, aggregate search, per-line random lyric
         styles, and a few behaviour fixes.

  The first commit of this repository, `baseline: folia-major upstream snapshot`, is an
  unmodified upstream snapshot; every commit after it makes up this fork's changes. The
  modified files and their dates are therefore verifiable with git:

      git log --oneline
      git diff baseline..HEAD --stat

  A per-item account of what changed, why, and where the boundaries are:
      docs/fork-changes.md

